No rights are granted except those expressly stated in this License.


3. Permitted use

For an Authorized Evaluation, the Evaluator may:

a. download the authorized OneShot evaluation distribution;

b. extract the distribution;

c. load and run the supplied Docker image;

d. install and operate OneShot on systems used for the Authorized Evaluation;

e. make temporary or technical copies strictly necessary to extract, load,
   cache, execute, test, inspect, demonstrate, or evaluate OneShot;

f. evaluate OneShot's functionality, behavior, performance, interfaces,
   architecture, outputs, and capabilities; and

g. demonstrate OneShot to authorized hackathon judges, organizers, reviewers,
   or other persons participating in the Authorized Evaluation.

No other use is permitted.


